    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis lovely three bedroomed detached bungalow is situated in the quiet and much sought after development of Kenure Park, conveniently close to the town center in Rush. The house is in one of the nicest residential areas of Rush which comprises a small group of bungalows in a quiet cul de sac setting close to two well maintained green spaces. \nThe bright and well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hall, comfortable living room through to dining room, kitchen, three bedrooms and family bathroom. The property benefits from private driveway parking along with front and rear gardens, offering plenty of scope for a new owner to create an attractive outdoor space.\nKenure Park is a well-established, low-density development in an excellent location beside the town park and within easy walking distance of Rush town centre, beaches and a wide range of local amenities.\nWhile the property would benefit from renovation and modernisation, it presents an exciting opportunity for purchasers to create a home to their own taste and specification. \nThere is a regular commuter train from Rush to Dublin offering fast access to Dublin city centre and connections to the Luas and DART services. The 33/33X bus services also offer good access to the city centre. The Fingal Express Rapid Coach Service which also serves the area connects into UCD. The MI, M50, Dublin Airport and Swords are all within a 10 - 20-minute drive away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.54m x 0.74m\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.54m x 2.74m\nWith carpet flooring\n\nLiving Room - 4.24m x 3.65m\nWith carpet flooring, coving to ceiling and feature fireplace.\n\nDining Room - 3.21m x 3.00m\nWith carpet flooring, coving to ceiling and reverse feature fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 2.67m x 2.98m\nWith laminate flooring, fitted kitchen units, tiled splashback and access to side/rear garden.\n\nBathroom - 1.50m x 2.98m\nTiled floor to ceiling, accessible shower unit with electric shower, w.c., & w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.44m x 2.98m\nWith carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.49m x 3.58m\nWith carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.45m x 2.63m\nWith carpet flooring.\n\nOutside - \nTo the front of the property is an enclosed garden featuring a mature lawn and established planting, together with a private driveway providing off-street parking. Two gated side entrances provide access to the rear garden.The rear garden is predominantly laid to lawn and complemented by mature planting, creating a private and attractive outdoor space. A concrete garden shed provides useful additional storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Detached 3 bed bungalow</li><li>Super location close to all amenities in Rush</li><li>Private driveway parking</li><li>Private rear garden.</li><li>Overlooking well maintained green area. </li><li>OFCH.</ul>"
      },
